<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 24/25.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 24/25.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, April 25 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   25.04.97	  24.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4804	    6.5276</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3264	    2.3349</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5374	    4.5500</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1671	    3.1759</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5217	    0.5215</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7742	    0.7731</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2908	    0.2919</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8581	    6.8817</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6962	    0.6958</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2702	    1.2735</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
